{
  "_comment": [
    "German translations of JupyterLab menu items that the official language pack",
    "(jupyterlab-language-pack-de-DE) leaves in English or gets wrong. Merged into the",
    "pack at build time by add_translations.py.",
    "  add:     keys the pack doesn't have; skipped if a newer pack adds them itself.",
    "  correct: keys the pack has, with a wrong value; always replaced.",
    "Values are lists: [text] for plain labels, [singular, plural] for labels that",
    "depend on the number of selected cells. Keys with a context are written as",
    "'context\\u0004text', e.g. 'menu\\u0004Terminal Theme'."
